# Staging folder for restaurant logo files before they're uploaded to
# Supabase Storage (plates-for-purpose-logos bucket) and never committed to
# the repo itself -- see plates-for-purpose/logos-inbox/README.md.
/plates-for-purpose/logos-inbox/*
!/plates-for-purpose/logos-inbox/README.md

